## Assumptions and gaps

This was a static review. The repository has no new application or toolchain to execute. I inspected the sibling package files, lockfile, and Pages workflow, but did not run installation or CI.

The legacy harness loads the original inline script. It does not demonstrate the proposed esbuild wrapper. The wrapper requires its own successful run. Canvas stubs also cannot establish visual fidelity or touch behavior.
